# linux-riscv config delta for Beryllium
# Base: arch/riscv/configs/defconfig (7.2) from beryllium-org/linux-beryllium#7.2
# Feed together with the upstream defconfig: `cp defconfig .config && cat def >> .config`
# Then `make ARCH=riscv olddefconfig` to expand.
# Values ported from the aarch64 `linux` package config where applicable.

